	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Accepi tuam, quam 9. aprilis ad me per <persName ref="p380">Ioannem <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>Birckmannum</persName>, civem et typographum <placeName ref="l267">Coloniensem</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>misisti, vir doctissime, in qua facile perspexi <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>tuam singularem erga me benevolentiam, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>et quamquam nunc temporis sim admodum occupatus, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>tamen, cum certum<note xml:id="fn18" type="footnote" n="18">certum nuncium. - Wer dieser Bote war, ist unbekannt.</note> nanciscerer, qui <placeName ref="l157">Francofur<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>tum</placeName> ire vellet, aliquid literarum ad te dare volui.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/>Si <placeName ref="l491">Argentinam</placeName>, ita ut fieri potest, rediero, ilico <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>ad te<note xml:id="fn19" type="footnote" n="19">Zu ergänzen ist ein Verb wie etwa "veniam".</note>, si dominus omnipotens clementer permiserit, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>ut coram inter nos de rebus variis commentari <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>possimus.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div2" corresp="regest2">
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Campanica, quae promisi, nunc misissem, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>si cum nostro constantissimo <persName ref="p18253">Nestore</persName> fuissem, cui <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>vix locus est relictus in ista amplissima di<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>tione idque tantum (mihi hic credas, velim, mi <lb xml:id="p1z15"/><persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>!)<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>Klammern ergänzt.</hi></note> propter coeptam ecclesiarum reformationem; <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>et etiamnum non cessant eum illi persequi, qui <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>instillare nituntur et scriptis et legationibus et <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>orationibus se non petere religionem!</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div3" corresp="regest3">
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Paucis ante <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>diebus novum quoddam mandatum a <persName ref="p19981">Romano</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>antichristo huc missum est (quod mihi et <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>aliis nonnullis, ut loquuntur, insinuatum est)<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi>Klammern ergänzt.</hi></note>, <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>quo et aqua et igne nobis interdicitur, si <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>non fuerimus cum Romana meretrice scortati, <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>canonicatus ademptus et propter doctrinae pr<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>ofessionem et quod constanter optimo <persName ref="p18253">Nestori</persName> ad<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>haeream et propter aliquam meam epistolam, quae a <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>nescio quibus intercepta Romam usque perlata est, in <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>qua satanissimum, ut ipsi interpretantur, non pro dignitate <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>descripsi.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Eam affirmant in ipso consistorio<pb type="scan" next="v."/> <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>coram papa et cardinalibus recitatam!</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Si verum est, vel<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>lem a me diligentissime eam epistolam esse scriptam, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>quod ego nunquam in epistolis facere soleo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div4" corresp="regest4">
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8011">Gvalteri</persName> vestri A<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>ntichristum legi, qui mihi perplacet; quem etiam <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>recitari vellem coram aposcopo<note xml:id="fn20" type="footnote" n="20">Diese Bezeichnung für den Papst gebrauchte <persName ref="p2262">Medmann</persName> auch schon in seinem Brief vom 20. Januar 1547; s. <bibl source="b22">HBBW XIX</bibl>, <ref target="file12809">Nr. 2760</ref>,[6].</note> <persName ref="p19981">Romano</persName>, ut intelligere<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>t clarius pios bene scire eum magnum illum ant[i]<lb xml:id="p2z7"/>christum<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c"><hi>Hier und unten Text teils im engen Einband verdeckt.</hi></note> esse, de quo prophetae, Christus et apostoli p[re]<lb xml:id="p2z8"/>dixerunt!</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div5" corresp="regest5">
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Sed ad tuas: Quod meas, quas in principu[m] <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>castris scripsi, acceperis, gaudeo.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">De civitatibus est omnino <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>ita, ut scribis, quae utinam magis de libertate cogitas[sent]!</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z11"/>Sed sero sapiunt Phryges<note xml:id="fn21" type="footnote" n="21"><bibl source="b56">Adagia</bibl> 1, 1, 28 (<bibl>ASD</bibl> II/1 141f, Nr. 28).</note>!</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">In <placeName>Gelria</placeName> apud <placeName>Arnemiu[m]</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>coeperunt <placeName ref="l875">Hispanicam</placeName> illam inquisitionem, quam <placeName ref="l1322">Lovaniens[es]</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>sophistae valde urgent.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l61">Bremenses</placeName> adhuc sibi constant, ap[ud] <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>quos docet noster d. <persName ref="p8371">Albertus</persName><note xml:id="fn22" type="footnote" n="22"><persName ref="p8371">Albert Hardenberg</persName>.</note>, cui in ultimis meis abs te [sa]lutem <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>asscripsi.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Ego tantum quaternas abs te accepi literas, qui[bus] <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>et respondi.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Mandatum contra nostrum <persName ref="p18253">Nestorem</persName> proxime tibi m[isero].</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div6" corresp="regest6">
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p2z17"/>Iam bene ac foeliciter vale, vir clarissime, meque totum tuum ess[e] <lb xml:id="p2z18"/>scito.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">10. septembris ex meo musaeo 1547.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z19"/>Tuus totus, etc.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div7" corresp="regest7">
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z20"/>Quicquid miseris ad d. <persName ref="p8371">Albertum</persName>, ego curabo perferri.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Oro, <lb xml:id="p2z21"/>ut quandoque scripseris.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Ego, ubi potero, semper respondero.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8011">Gval<lb xml:id="p2z22"/>terus</persName><note xml:id="fnd" type="footnote" n="d"><hi>In der Vorlage</hi> <persName ref="p8011">Gvalteri</persName>.</note> a me salutetur.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Ignosce notuli<pb/><lb xml:id="p3z2"/>s<note xml:id="fn23" type="footnote" n="23">Wohl als entwurfartiges Brieflein zu verstehen.</note><lb xml:id="p3z3"/>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf f. 1441v.:]</note>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p4z1"/>Clarissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Henrico Bul<lb xml:id="p4z2"/>lingero</persName>, evangelii apud <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinos</placeName> <lb xml:id="p4z3"/>syncerissimo doctori, etc., <lb xml:id="p4z4"/>suo observando S. <lb xml:id="p4z5"/><placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
